{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a charming roguelike adventure where turtles are your fiercest allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up, equip a range of skills, tend to your garden and cook up a range of delicious meals to keep your team prepared for the toughest battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock over 350 different turtles, with each new one granting a permanent boost to every one in your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategise, customise your cottage, and never give up as you try to reach as far as you can in the gauntlet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For a more mechanics focused description: This is an auto-battler game with rouguelike buffs on each run. There are various ways to gain permanent stats so your power floor will raise with every run. Random gear and spells drop in the gauntlet to make each run feel unique. If you like creature collector games, then this one may appeal to you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3703160?t=1749286399","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3703160?t=1749286399","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703160/93f7acf144b25e55a1901ec2e1092f994d14af66/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749286399","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703160/93f7acf144b25e55a1901ec2e1092f994d14af66/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749286399","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a charming roguelike adventure where turtles are your fiercest allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up, equip a range of skills, tend to your garden and cook up a range of delicious meals to keep your team prepared for the toughest battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock over 350 different turtles, with each new one granting a permanent boost to every one in your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategise, customise your cottage, and never give up as you try to reach as far as you can in the gauntlet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For a more mechanics focused description: This is an auto-battler game with rouguelike buffs on each run. There are various ways to gain permanent stats so your power floor will raise with every run. Random gear and spells drop in the gauntlet to make each run feel unique. If you like creature collector games, then this one may appeal to you.</p>","developers":["Copper Hawk Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703160/0b1bbea5431a51e9ce463612e9d67f5e8a68412c/header.jpg?t=1749286399","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3703160/176794009/3c867d7a7d3982b791f92a38c984443e38b75cef/1750424902/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747572286","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3703160/176794009/3c867d7a7d3982b791f92a38c984443e38b75cef/1750424902/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747572286","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3703160/176794009/3c867d7a7d3982b791f92a38c984443e38b75cef/1750424902/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1747572286","id":257137977,"name":"Pocket Turtles Steam","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257137977/a1fb42a3d0e627d3e66f4cc8080f998b08e18fea/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747572286"}],"name":"Pocket Turtles","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option